efault\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Drier than you think, chalk.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/64/Drier_than_you_think%2C_chalk..png/revision/latest?cb=20251023214254\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Drier than you think, chalk.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/64/Drier_than_you_think%2C_chalk..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251023214254\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/64/Drier_than_you_think%2C_chalk..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251023214254 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/64/Drier_than_you_think%2C_chalk..png/revision/latest?cb=20251023214254 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Drier than you think, chalk.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Drier_than_you_think%2C_chalk..png\" data-image-name=\"Drier than you think, chalk..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">20</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Is_that_number_got_curves%3F\" title=\"Is that number got curves?\">Is that number got curves?</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Am_I_an_idiom%3F\" title=\"Am I an idiom?\">Am I an idiom?</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Drier than you think, chalk.</b></i> is the seventh episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">Series 20</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 23 October 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Drier_than_you_think,_chalk.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a> observes \"Drier than you think, chalk\" during his attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Dribble_a_technicolour_picture_of_your_hero\" title=\"Dribble a technicolour picture of your hero\">Dribble a technicolour picture of your hero</a> task after biting into a stick of chalk. The title card shows a security camera, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Steal_the_statue_of_Archimedes\" title=\"Steal the statue of Archimedes\">Steal the statue of Archimedes</a> task, and a mole plush, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_exactly_63_points_by_bopping_Alex_on_the_head\" title=\"Get exactly 63 points by bopping Alex on the head\">Get exactly 63 points by bopping Alex on the head</a> task, which replicates the gameplay of <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whac-A-Mole\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Whac-A-Mole\">Whac-A-Mole</a></i>.</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Drier_than_you_think,_chalk.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i>The five comedic contestants are pushed to their limits as they attempt to pull off a heist, pay dubious homage to their heroes and shout about foodstuffs while wielding a mallet. <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a> does a spot of rewiring, <a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a> spews some blue jelly, <a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</a> asks for a comfort break, <a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\">Reece Shearsmith</a> hocks up some bread and <a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a> squawks like an exotic bird. <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> takes it all in before handing out some points, while <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> gets to wear an important hat.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/20/7/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ania Magliano</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Maisie Adam</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Ellis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Reece Shearsmith</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_you_can_either_ride_or_rip\" title=\"Best thing you can either ride or rip\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing you can either ride or rip.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Steal_the_statue_of_Archimedes\" title=\"Steal the statue of Archimedes\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Steal the statue of Archimedes.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Dribble_a_technicolour_picture_of_your_hero\" title=\"Dribble a technicolour picture of your hero\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Dribble a technicolour picture of your hero. Your technicolour picture must only be made from things that have travelled directly from your mouth to the tray through the air and cannot be tampered with post-dribble.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_exactly_63_points_by_bopping_Alex_on_the_head\" title=\"Get exactly 63 points by bopping Alex on the head\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get exactly 63 points by bopping Alex on the head. You must shout a different type of food on each bop to register the bop. If you bop anyone other than Alex, five bops will be deducted from your total score. You must stay in the hutch.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Avoid_the_Taskmaster%27s_big_ball\" title=\"Avoid the Taskmaster&#39;s big ball\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Avoid the Taskmaster's big ball. You must stand on the circle but you must not step on any gold. You must be facing and staring at the Taskmaster sign at all times and after the Taskmaster releases his big ball, you may each take one step. The first person touched by the Taskmaster's big ball each round is eliminated.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">20\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Drier_than_you_think,_chalk.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster\"><i>Drier than you think, chalk.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920140528\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.107 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.151 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1017/1000000\nPost‐expand include size